entries[451940] = { ["name"] = "Azerite Surge", ["text"] = "100 yd range\nInstant\nInhale, stoking your inner flame. Release to exhale, burning enemies in a cone in front of you for [((163.409% of Spell Power)) + ((39.4834% of Spell Power) * (10 + 0 ))] Fire damage, reduced beyond 5 targets. [ Sands of Time : Increases the duration of your active Ebon Might effects by 2 sec ]\nEmpowering causes more of the damage to be dealt immediately instead of over time.\n\nI: Deals [(163.409% of Spell Power)] damage instantly and [(39.4834% of Spell Power) * (10 + 0 )] over (20 + 0 ) sec.\n\nII: Deals [(163.409% of Spell Power) + ((39.4834% of Spell Power) * 3)] damage instantly and [(39.4834% of Spell Power) * (7 + 0 )] over (14 + 0 ) sec.\n\nIII: Deals [(163.409% of Spell Power) + ((39.4834% of Spell Power) * 6)] damage instantly and [(39.4834% of Spell Power) * (4 + 0 )] over (8 + 0 ) sec." }
entries[451943] = { ["name"] = "Jade Swiftness", ["text"] = "Instant\nWindwalker\nStrike the ground fiercely to expose a path of jade for 30 sec that increases your movement speed by 20% while inside, dealing (40% of Attack Power) Nature damage to up to 5 enemies , and restoring (91% of Spell Power) health to up to 5 allies within 30 yds caught in the path. Up to 5 enemies caught in the path\n\nMistweaver\nStrike the ground fiercely to expose a path of jade for 30 sec, dealing (40% of Attack Power) Nature damage to up to 5 enemies, and restoring (91% of Spell Power) health to up to 5 allies within 30 yds caught in the path.\n\nYour abilities have a 6% chance of resetting the cooldown of Jadefire Stomp while fighting within the path." }
